/extras/37e0555d8a80f6902b57719f1b3f241d.mp4?t=1771585481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN EVER-GROWING EXPERIENCE - The Early Access release launches with 35+ quests across Acts 1 and 2, with over 130 total quests planned for the campaign as development continues</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The included Tutorial allows both new and old players to get accommodated with the basic mechanics and gameplay</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP ONLINE MULTIPLAYER \u2013 FROSTHAVEN supports 2-4 players so you can play with your friends anywhere and at any time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Snapshot Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347080/3942da660b08ce61a65c03a3baa5050123d15e91/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1771585481","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Snapshot Games Inc. Developed by Snapshot Games Inc. Published by Arc Games Inc. All brands, product names and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2347080/523128453/e7c86620f919b6f44f4c21f59f678962e2f075e4/1769011615/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769100378","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2347080/523128453/e7c86620f919b6f44f4c21f59f678962e2f075e4/1769011615/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769100378","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.s